{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "star-sso-collection-v2",
    "name": "Star One SSO API Collection",
    "description": "# Star One SSO API Collection\n\nOfficial Single Sign-On (SSO) test collection for Star One frontend team.\n\n## 2-Stage Flow:\n1. **Stage 1: Central Authentication**\n   - `POST /v1/sso/send-otp` -> Sends OTP (debug_otp returned in local environment)\n   - `POST /v1/sso/verify-otp` -> Verifies OTP & returns `star_one_session_token` + `allowed_products`\n2. **Stage 2: Product Launch**\n   - `POST /v1/sso/launch/{product_key}` (Bearer Token) -> Performs live legacy handshake and returns original product app payload.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "test_otp",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "product_key",
      "value": "star_steller"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication (Stage 1)",
      "description": "Central Star One OTP Authentication endpoints.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Multi-App User (Stellar + SFA + Link - 8638510331)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Send OTP - Multi-App User",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.debug_otp) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('test_otp', res.debug_otp);",
                      "    console.log('OTP captured:', res.debug_otp);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"mobile_number\": \"8638510331\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/send-otp",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sso", "send-otp"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Verify OTP - Multi-App User (Saves auth_token)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.status === true && res.star_one_session_token) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', res.star_one_session_token);",
                      "    console.log('Saved token to {{auth_token}}');",
                      "    console.log('Allowed Products:', res.allowed_products);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"mobile_number\": \"8638510331\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{test_otp}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/verify-otp",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "sso", "verify-otp"]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
